# Commands Summary

| Command | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| `tee` | Displayed output while simultaneously writing it to a file |
| `sort` | Sorted the contents of a file alphabetically |
| `grep` | Searched for matching text within a file |
| `cut` | Extracted selected fields from delimited data |
| `sed` | Replaced text within a file |
| `|` (Pipe) | Passed the output of one command as input to another |

